# sweep: after-main
# The feed the main route followed: its list pages, an article reads to its
# end and counts as read, search narrows the list, and everything opens again
# with the network gone and after a restart.
wait-for Feeds
expect NASA Science
tap NASA Science
wait-for unread of 10 articles
expect Search articles
expect 1 of 2
tap-id list-next
wait-for 2 of 2
clean
shot feed-page-2
tap-id list-back
wait-for 1 of 2
tap-id item-0
wait-idle 20000
clean
shot article
# Page turns to the end of the article; the reader says when there is no more.
# The article is live, so its length changes; turning past the end is
# harmless, so the route turns well past any article the feed has carried.
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
page next
wait-idle
wait-for This is the end
clean
shot article-end
tap Back
wait-idle
wait-for 9 unread of 10 articles
clean
shot feed-after-reading
# Searching one feed's saved articles, and a search that finds nothing.
tap Search articles
wait-for Words in the title, author or article
type zzqxv
tap Search
wait-for No saved articles match this search.
expect Results for zzqxv
expect Change search
clean
shot feed-search-empty
tap Back
wait-for 9 unread of 10 articles
expect Search articles
tap Back
wait-idle
# Search saved looks through every feed's saved articles at once.
tap Search saved
wait-for Words in the title, author or article
type nasa
tap Search
wait-idle 10000
wait-for Results for nasa
expect NASA Science
clean
shot saved-search
tap Clear
wait-for Ready offline
restart
wait-for Ready offline
expect NASA Science
scenario offline
tap NASA Science
wait-for 9 unread of 10 articles
tap-id item-1
wait-idle 20000
clean
shot article-offline
tap Back
wait-idle
wait-for 8 unread of 10 articles
# Refreshing with no network keeps the articles and says why.
tap Refresh
wait-idle 30000
wait 5000
wait-for Wi-Fi
expect 8 unread of 10 articles
clean
shot feed-refresh-offline
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Refresh all
wait-idle 30000
wait 5000
clean
shot shelf-refresh-offline
expect NASA Science
scenario normal
tap NASA Science
wait-for unread of 10 articles
tap Unfollow
wait-for No feeds yet
expect-missing Ready offline
clean
shot unfollowed
